{
    "title": "2048 for smart watch",
    "description": "The 2048 game is a fun, addictive and a very simple puzzle game.\r\nJoin the numbers and get to the 2048 tile!\r\n\r\nIt's smallest (only 22k) and ads free 2048 app ! This is 2in1 version !\r\nYou installing the game on your mobile phone and get two identical working games: one on your mobile phone and one on your smartwatch.\r\n\r\nIt working on all devices with all screen resolution, including Wear OS smartwatches (round and square) !\r\n\r\nIf you like this app please do not forget to give a positive feedback !!!\r\nRecently the rating this app fell 100% anonymously (probably competitors) from 4.6 to 4.2 :-(\r\n \r\nHow to play: \r\nSwipe (Up, Down, Left, Right) to move the tiles.\r\nWhen two tiles with the same number touch, they merge into one.\r\nEvery turn, a new tile will randomly appear in an empty spot on the outer frame of the board with a value of either 2 (90%) or 4 (10%).\r\nWhen 2048 tile is created, the player wins!\r\n\r\nUse long press to exit.",
